**: *It is essential that he act now.*"}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"It is ___ that wages lag. (clear)","a":"clear","why":"adjetivo."},{"s":"It is essential that governments ___ early. (act)","a":"act","why":"subjuntivo."},{"s":"It is ___ that prices will fall. (unlikely)","a":"unlikely","why":"adjetivo."},{"s":"It is surprising ___ some ignore it. (that)","a":"that","why":"that-clause."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["wage growth","crescimento salarial"],["price increase","aumento de preços"],["economic sign","sinal econômico"],["government action","ação do governo"],["inflation rate","taxa de inflação"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["inflation","worrying","Why","is"],"ans":"Why is inflation worrying","pt":"Por que a inflação preocupa?"},{"words":["do","What","should","governments"],"ans":"What should governments do","pt":"O que os governos devem fazer?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"price increase","pos":"word","pt":"aumento de preços","ex":"Price increase.","expt":"Aumento de preços."},{"w":"economic sign","pos":"word","pt":"sinal econômico","ex":"Economic sign.","expt":"Sinal econômico."},{"w":"government action","pos":"word","pt":"ação do governo","ex":"Government action.","expt":"Ação do governo."},{"w":"household income","pos":"word","pt":"renda familiar","ex":"Household income.","expt":"Renda familiar."},{"w":"price comparison","pos":"word","pt":"comparação de preços","ex":"Price comparison.","expt":"Comparação de preços."},{"w":"economist’s view","pos":"word","pt":"visão do economista","ex":"Economist’s view.","expt":"Visão do economista."},{"w":"market signal","pos":"word","pt":"sinal de mercado","ex":"Market signal.","expt":"Sinal de mercado."},{"w":"real wage","pos":"word","pt":"salário real","ex":"Real wage.","expt":