 they ignore","Don’t ignore signs."],["he / she / it ignores","Não ignore sinais."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Interview","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Interview","lines":[["Interviewer","Why is inflation worrying?","Por que a inflação preocupa?"],["Economist","It is clear that wages don’t rise as fast as prices.","É claro que salários não sobem tão rápido quanto os preços."],["Interviewer","What should governments do?","O que os governos devem fazer?"],["Economist","It is essential that they act early.","É essencial que ajam cedo."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Ligações e assimilação","items":[{"label":"Ligações e assimilação","note":"Pratique em voz alta.","words":[]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Use it is clear that.","pt":"Use.","model":"It is clear that prices rose."},{"q":"Use it is essential that.","pt":"Use.","model":"It is essential that we save."},{"q":"Use it is unlikely that.","pt":"Use.","model":"It is unlikely that it will rain."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with It + be + adjective + that.","model":"It is clear that wages don’t rise as fast as prices. It is essential that governments act early. It is surprising that some ignore the signs. It is important that citizens save. It is unlikely that prices will fall soon.","checklist":["Usei **It is + adj + that**","5 frases"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “wage growth” mean?","opts":["aumento de preços","crescimento salarial","ação do governo"],"ans":1,"why":"**wage growth** = crescimento salarial."},{"q":"What does “price increase” mean?","opts":["sinal econômico","taxa de inflação","aumento de preços"],"ans":2,"why":"**price increase** = aumento de preços."},{"q":"What does “economic sign” mean?","opts":["si